# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and point it at your Decal server's
# public address — the same one you'd type into a browser at home.
#
# This is read by capacitor.config.ts at build time, so it needs to be set
# BEFORE running any of: `cap sync`, `cap add ios`, `cap add android`,
# `cap open ios`, `cap open android`. If you change it later, re-run
# `npx cap sync` and rebuild in Xcode/Android Studio.
DECAL_SERVER_URL=https://decal.yourhouse.com
